<title>UK: LME People - Peerage for Raj Bagri.</title>
<headline>LME People - Peerage for Raj Bagri.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>London Metal Exchange (LME) chairman Raj Bagri is made a peer in Queen Elizabeth's New Year's Honours List announced on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Of Indian descent, Bagri, 66, is recognised for his contribution as a prominent businessman and as a leading member of the UK's Asian community. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7729</p>
